# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# cv/ -- THIS REPO IS PUBLIC.
#
# ONLY the public CV lives here: cv-andres-gonzalez.tex, the single document
# published at gonor.me/docs/cv-andres-gonzalez.pdf.
#
# Role variants (data scientist, insurance, risk, insurtech, ...) are tailored
# to specific positions and are NOT shareable. They live in the private
# GonorAndres/claude-job repo. Never add them back here.
#
# This is an ALLOWLIST: everything under cv/ is ignored unless named below, so
# a new variant cannot be committed by accident.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
cv/*
cv/**/
!cv/cv-andres-gonzalez.tex
!cv/qr_portfolio.png
!cv/build.sh
!cv/AGENTS.md
!cv/README.md

# Compiled output and LaTeX build artifacts (defense in depth)
cv/**/*.pdf
cv/**/*.aux
cv/**/*.out
cv/**/*.toc
cv/**/*.fls
cv/**/*.fdb_latexmk
cv/**/*.synctex.gz
cv/**/*.bbl
cv/**/*.blg
cv/**/*.dvi

# Private: job postings, application emails, cover letters, exam proofs
cv/**/*_job.md
cv/**/*_email.md
cv/**/*_cover*.md
cv/docs/

# Private: employer-specific variants (which companies were applied to is not public)
cv/**/alsea_*
cv/**/autofinanciamiento_*
cv/**/banorte_*
cv/**/bbva_*
cv/**/bess_*
cv/**/vinkos_*
cv/**/greenday*
cv/**/kayum*
